-      TASK
-      Build a reusable structural identifiability audit over a finite policy class, observation support, and scalar estimand. Emit constructive collision witnesses for non-identifying supports and a minimum identifying support for the declared V557 held-selection policy class. Verify task-scoped runtime receipt conformance without running an LLM.
